  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "2 cups quick cooking oats",
    "1.5 cups packed brown sugar",
    "1 teaspoon baking soda",
    "½ teaspoon salt",
    "1.25 cups butter, melted",
    "2 cups apples - peeled, cored and sliced",
    "0.5 cup chopped walnuts",
    "1.5 cups caramel ice cream topping",
    "0.5 cup all-purpose flour"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Line a 9x13-inch baking pan with parchment.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Q6b1meqr5szXXi8V1aLvom3D0-Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11497-caramel-apple-bars-DDMFS-step-01-fb48dbd0cc0c4290ba0be15a0bff851d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11497/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the crust: Combine 2 cups flour, quick cooking oats, brown sugar, baking soda, and salt in a large bowl; stir in melted butter and mix until crumbly. Press 2/3 of crust mixture into the prepared baking pan. Bake in the preheated oven for 18 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Kn9PYfrLTOnKwbx1QZROPzRbzZA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11497-caramel-apple-bars-DDMFS-step-02-3e02213bf60d4f7a9e239bd45d249d0a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11497/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, make the caramel filling: Combine caramel topping and remaining 1/2 cup of flour in a small pan over medium heat. Bring to a boil, stirring constantly, and cook for 3 to 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/e2gd77nbEHtQ25RHyiZU_wZSS6k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11497-caramel-apple-bars-DDMFS-step-03-a7d170da7b144c78934935ae1f15fe5f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11497/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread apple slices evenly over baked crust; sprinkle nuts on top. Pour caramel filling over apple layer; crumble remaining crust mixture over the top of everything.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gRz0f6cAxzg6Iz-D8sK4etl1EDg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11497-caramel-apple-bars-DDMFS-step-04-a86e6d019b5e45bc811c25869aaeb7f6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11497/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until top is crisp and golden brown, about 30 minutes. Cool completely before slicing into bars.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/01KDHLp0dHnSglALLAJKMV04WZ8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11497-caramel-apple-bars-DDMFS-step-05-f1aa6aec2ba34b359a0b7d3b04165b56.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11497/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
